Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Covers BranchRequestsController (6 endpoints - the seven-status
demand-ledger workflow that composes TransactionsController's
transfers).

- Add Swagger/Examples/BranchRequestExamples.cs and register it in
  ExampleCatalog.
- Backfill missing <response> XML doc tags on all 6 actions.
- Confirm via BranchRequestService that GetAll/GetById give a system
  admin cross-tenant read access while Create/Confirm/Refuse/Cancel
  reject an admin token -- this controller's doc comment already
  stated this accurately (contrast with the CardDisposalsController
  bug found and fixed in S4).
- Document that Confirm's generated-transfer failures reuse
  TransferErrors/StockErrors directly via ITransferComposer, the same
  validation path a direct TransactionsController.Create uses --
  examples mix both BranchRequest.* and Transfer.* codes in the same
  response set for that reason.
- Update Docs/PROJECT_KNOWLEDGE.md (§3, §18, metadata trailer) with
  S5 coverage, marking the Swagger documentation initiative complete:
  all 15 controllers / ~90 endpoints now have full example coverage.

This is the final phase of the 5-phase Swagger documentation plan.
